# WAVE 4C — GENERATED / LOCAL ARTIFACTS (never commit)
# Each entry verified as non-source: build output, scratch, backup or
# captured sample data. No tracked source file is hidden by these rules.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Local scratch directories (.tmp-ssh, .tmp-tsc, ...)
.tmp-*/

# Worker build / dry-run output and the nested dist dump left by an old deploy
